<title>FRANCE: Rouen Feb 1-12 flour exports 23,924 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Feb 1-12 flour exports 23,924 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flour exports from Rouen reached 23,924 tonnes between February 1 and February 12, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Flour exports totalled 67,000 tonnes for the whole of February 1996.</p>
<p>February 1-12 exports included 21,774 tonnes for Yemen and 2,150 tonnes for west Africa.</p>
<p>One ship was also loading 10,000 tonnes of flour at Rouen, officials said. The destination was Libya.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
